          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — integrative, whole-person care. Book a VIP Day or ask a question about our approach.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --brand-1: #2a7a6f; /* deep teal */\\n      --brand-2: #9fd3c7; /* soft mint */\\n      --accent: #f6a623; /* warm gold */\\n      --muted: #65737e;\\n      --bg: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(250,255,252,1) 0%, rgba(244,252,250,1) 100%);\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\\n      --radius: 14px;\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#0b2b26}\\n    header{position:relative;z-index:3}\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,var(--brand-2),transparent 40%),linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand-1),#15564f)}\\n    .logo svg{width:36px;height:36px}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0}\\n    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .nav-links a{color:rgba(11,43,38,0.9);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    .nav-links a:hover{background:rgba(42,122,111,0.08)}\\n\\n    /* hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:36px 0}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(12,30,26,0.06)}\\n    .eyebrow{font-size:13px;color:var(--brand-1);font-weight:600}\\n    h2{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* pattern */\\n    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;right:-120px;top:-80px;opacity:0.14;transform:rotate(12deg);z-index:0}\\n    .pattern-wrap svg{width:620px;height:620px}\\n\\n    /* form */\\n    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(8,30,26,0.06);font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .row .col{flex:1}\\n    .cta-btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--brand-1),#186e65);color:white;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:0;font-weight:700}\\n    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(11,43,38,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}\\n\\n    /* info cards */\\n    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.8));padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(11,43,38,0.04)}\\n    .card h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* sections */\\n    section{margin:28px 0}\\n    .two-up{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(159,211,199,0.18);color:var(--brand-1);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* schedule table */\\n    table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:8px}\\n    th,td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(8,30,26,0.06);text-align:left}\\n    th{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* pricing card */\\n    .pricing{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .price-card{flex:1;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffe);border:1px solid rgba(11,43,38,0.04)}\\n    .price{font-size:24px;color:var(--brand-1);font-weight:800}\\n\\n    /* faq */\\n    .faq-item{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),#fff);border:1px solid rgba(8,30,26,0.04)}\\n    details{cursor:pointer}\\n    summary{font-weight:700}\\n\\n    footer{margin:36px 0 80px;padding:18px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .two-up{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .pattern-wrap{display:none}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"pattern-wrap\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <!-- Decorative SVG; a unique organic grid motif that echoes a leaf lattice -->\\n    <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 400 400\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"subtle background pattern\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#dff6f1\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.9\\\" />\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f6fff9\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.7\\\" />\\n        </linearGradient>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 30 C10 10,30 10,40 30\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#bfe9df\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 10 C10 30,30 30,40 10\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#c9efe6\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" opacity=\\\"0.7\\\"/>\\n        </pattern>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n      <rect x=\\\"-20\\\" y=\\\"-20\\\" width=\\\"440\\\" height=\\\"440\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.85\\\" />\\n      <g transform=\\\"translate(50,50) rotate(-8)\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#9fd3c7\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.2\\\" opacity=\\\"0.35\\\">\\n        <circle cx=\\\"80\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"68\\\" />\\n        <circle cx=\\\"200\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"52\\\" />\\n        <circle cx=\\\"300\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" r=\\\"94\\\" />\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <header class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n            <path d=\\\"M50 12c11 0 22 9 26 20 4 11 0 24-9 31-12 9-32 21-43 8-10-13 1-31 7-43C43 19 49 12 50 12z\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\" />\\n            <path d=\\\"M35 70c7-9 18-14 28-16 9-1 15-9 16-18 1-7-6-16-15-19-12-4-26 7-32 16-7 11-12 22-2 37z\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\" />\\n            <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#f6a623\\\" />\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"nav-links\\\" role=\\\"navigation\\\" aria-label=\\\"primary navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Studio</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Care Plans</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Health Topics</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Method</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Contact & Scheduling</div>\\n        <h2>Talk with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We practice integrative medicine centered on education and whole-person support. Use the form to describe your goals, and we'll respond with next steps — including VIP Day options for focused care.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"cards\\\" role=\\\"list\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n            <h4>Phone</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Call or text: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n            <h4>Email</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Write us: <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n            <h4>Location</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — telehealth available</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"hero-card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-form-heading\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"contact-form-heading\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Request Time</h3>\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n          <input name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Full name\\\" required />\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"col\\\"><input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required /></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"col\\\"><input name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone (optional)\\\" /></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <select name=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"vip_day\\\">VIP Day — focused intake</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"new_patient\\\">New patient intake</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"follow_up\\\">Follow-up visit</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"question\\\">Quick question / message</option>\\n          </select>\\n          <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Briefly describe concerns or goals (sleep, stress, digestion, energy, inflammation)\\\" ></textarea>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"cta-btn\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\\\">Call now</a>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-size:12px\\\">We do not promise cures. Our recommendations focus on education, lifestyle, and whole-person planning. Responses typically within 2 business days.</p>\\n        </form>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\" role=\\\"main\\\">\\n    <!-- ritual section -->\\n    <section id=\\\"ritual\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"ritual-heading\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"two-up\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <span class=\\\"pill\\\">A thoughtful ritual</span>\\n          <h3 id=\\\"ritual-heading\\\">The intake ritual: what you bring matters</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Our first meeting follows a gentle ritual: we listen, map your history, and prioritize. This is a collaborative space — expect questions about diet, stress, sleep, relationships, and daily rhythms.</p>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Complete a short health questionnaire before your visit</li>\\n            <li>Bring a list of medications & supplements</li>\\n            <li>Be ready to share recent labs or medical notes (if available)</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <aside class=\\\"hero-card\\\" style=\\\"align-self:start\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Preparing for a VIP Day</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A VIP Day is an intensive, single-day session for a deep dive and an actionable plan. It includes extended intake, targeted recommendations, and a follow-up plan. Ask about optional educational lab options.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Request a VIP Day</a></div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- what_to_expect -->\\n    <section id=\\\"what-to-expect\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"expect-heading\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"expect-heading\\\">What to expect after you reach out</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We orient visits around four practical steps so you know the pathway: intake, plan, implement, review. Below is a short breakdown of our typical workflow.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Intake</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">We collect history, current concerns, and health priorities.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Investigate</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Discussion of targeted labs when clinically useful; always optional and educational.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Plan</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A clear, prioritized care plan that emphasizes self-care and sustainable steps.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Follow-up</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Short check-ins or a scheduled review to adjust the approach as needed.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- schedule -->\\n    <section id=\\\"schedule\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"schedule-heading\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"schedule-heading\\\">Typical availability & scheduling</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We offer in-person and telehealth blocks. Use the request form or call to find specific openings. Below are common appointment formats and sample times.</p>\\n      <table aria-describedby=\\\"schedule-heading\\\">\\n        <thead>\\n          <tr><th>Visit type</th><th>Length</th><th>Sample times</th></tr>\\n        </thead>\\n        <tbody>\\n          <tr><td>VIP Day</td><td>3–4 hours</td><td>Mon / Wed mornings</td></tr>\\n          <tr><td>New Patient Intake</td><td>90 minutes</td><td>Tues / Thurs afternoons</td></tr>\\n          <tr><td>Follow-up</td><td>30–45 minutes</td><td>Weekly blocks, flexible</td></tr>\\n          <tr><td>Short Consult</td><td>15–20 minutes</td><td>Fri mornings (quick queries)</td></tr>\\n        </tbody>\\n      </table>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Note: exact availability varies. If time is urgent, call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- pricing -->\\n    <section id=\\\"pricing\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"pricing-heading\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"pricing-heading\\\">Investment & packages</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Below are typical fees. Packages are customizable; we focus on value and focused education rather than one-off quick fixes.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"pricing\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">VIP Day</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">Customized — inquire</div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Extended intake, detailed plan, and resources. Best for complex, time-sensitive goals.</p>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\">Learn more</a></p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">New Patient</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$295</div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Comprehensive 90-minute intake with a personalized roadmap and follow-up recommendations.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Follow-up</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$85</div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Short visits to monitor progress and tweak the plan.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13px\\\">Insurance: we provide superbills; patients are responsible for verifying benefits. No promises of cure — care emphasizes education and self-management.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- faq -->\\n    <section id=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-heading\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"faq-heading\\\">Frequently asked questions</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Do you guarantee results?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">We do not guarantee cures. We provide tailored education, lifestyle strategies, and evidence-informed options to support your health goals.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Are labs required?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Labs are optional and recommended when they add educational value. We discuss benefits, costs, and interpretation together.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>How do I prepare for a VIP Day?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Complete pre-visit forms, gather recent labs and medication lists, and note a few measurable goals to prioritize for the day.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Do you work with specialists?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Yes. We collaborate with specialists when needed and help integrate recommendations into a cohesive plan.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- cta -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"cta-heading\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h3 id=\\\"cta-heading\\\">Ready to begin?</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Request a visit, ask a question, or book a VIP Day for a concentrated plan. We’ll guide you with clear, practical steps.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:10px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email us</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div>•</div>\\n        <div>Contact: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — Information provided is educational and not a guaranteed cure.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# contact.html — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} (Holistic / Integrative Medicine)\\n\\nThis file is the contact page for the clinic_modern layoutFamily. It includes the required section pack: hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing, faq, and cta. The page is built with responsive CSS, an inline SVG decorative pattern, and semantic HTML. No external resources are referenced.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n\\nNotes:\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}; update action as needed or wire to your form handler.\\n- Visual assets are embedded inline using scalable SVG. A complementary pattern file is expected at assets/img/pattern.svg in the full bundle; the hero uses an inline SVG to ensure the page is visually complete even without external files.\\n- Content emphasizes education and whole-person care; it avoids promises of cures per holistic medicine guidance.\\n\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\n- Navigation uses descriptive labels that differ from other site templates (Studio, Care Plans, Health Topics, Method, Invest, About, Book, Connect).\\n- The form and interactive elements include clear labels and ARIA where helpful.\\n\\nIntegration:\\n- Include this file with the rest of the site pages: index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html.\\n- Ensure server-side placeholders are replaced before publishing.\\n\\nLicense: content crafted for a VIP day offering model; adjust pricing and language to your practice policies.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
